{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25865","headline":"拜三川守 · 李绅","name":"拜三川守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恭承宠诏临伊洛，静守朝章化比闾。\n风变市儿惊偃草，雨晴郊薮谬随车。\n改张琴瑟移胶柱，止息笙篁辨鲁鱼。\n唯有从容期一德，使齐文教奉皇居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}